title: Do_The_Dishes
---
<<set $Goblin = GetPartDisplayName("Goblin")>>
<<set $Lady = GetPartDisplayName("Lady")>>
<<set $Soldier = GetPartDisplayName("Soldier")>>
<<set $Wiki = GetPartDisplayName("Wiki")>>
<<set $Hiki = GetPartDisplayName("Hiki")>>

{$Soldier}: There is no reason these dishes should be this piled-up.
{$Goblin}: Cool your jets, jarhead! We're doing our best here.
{$Soldier}: You and I both know that isn't true.
{$Lady}: I think that Goblin and our new friend are doing wonderfully!
{$Lady}: In fact, I think we'll be out of the house in no time!
{$Wiki}: Likelihood of that being true: 13%.
{$Goblin}: Thanks for that, ya fuckin nerd.
===
